It is Tuesday morning at the Infopark office.
I am working at my desk.
Deepa comes to my desk.
"Maya, are you busy on Friday evening?" Deepa asks.
I check my calendar.
I play badminton on Thursday evenings.
So I think that I am free on Friday.
"I don't have any other plans on Friday," I reply.
"Then you should come to my house for dinner," Deepa says.
I feel very happy.
"I will make a special Kerala meal," she says.
"Very happy, Deepa."
"I will definitely come," I say.
"I will send the location to your phone," she says.
"Okay, we will see each other on Friday," I say.
Deepa smiles and goes back.
